|Notes=
* Achuka is '''''[[:Category:Naakuals|<span style="color:#931711;">The Firebrand Naakual</span>]]'''''.
* Players can only enter the [[Wildskeeper Reive]] in which Achuka is present by possessing a [[Magma mitigation set]] purchased from [[Dimmian]] and using it to pass through the ??? located at (E-5) in [[Morimar Basalt Fields]].
* Damage taken by Achuka is proportional to the the colonization rate of Morimar Basalt Fields, with Achuka taking decreased damage as the colonization rate decreases and 0 damage at very low rates.
** Damage resistance is ignored by forms of damage that bypass shields such as [[Quick Draw]].
*Normal auto-attacks are one of three types:
**Bite: Single target physical damage, Defense Down (-20%)
**Charge: Frontal AoE physical damage, stun, light knockback
**Spin: AoE physical damage, heavy knockback

*Can be easily dispelled of spikes and other buffs. Regains them but a couple RDMs can keep him dispelled easily.
}}
