{{Adversary Description
|Image=
|Class=NM 
|Type=Demons 
|Family=Dvergr 
|Main.Job={{question}} 
|Sub.Job=
|Crystal=
|Detects=True Sight
|Notes= 
*Casts [[Blaze Spikes]], [[:Category:Elemental Debuff|Elemental Debuffs]], single target tier V nukes, [[Drain]], [[Aspir II]], [[Firaga III]], [[Flare]], and single target enfeebles at [[Chainspell]] speed.
**If the target is out of melee range, it will continue to cast spells at [[Chainspell]] speed with minimal delay between spells.
**Can run out of MP during the course of the fight.
*Uses all Dvergr TP moves including '''Necrobane''' and '''Cackle'''
**Cackle will need to be erased quickly if possible (or have its effects prevented with [[Diabolos]]' [[Dream Shroud]]) as it is frequently immediately followed by a powerful nuke.
**[[Holy Water]]s and/or fast [[Cursna]]s recommended for Necropurge and Necrobane as the Curse effect reduces maximum HP by 50%.
**'''Thundris Shriek''' (AoE damage, [[Terror]]) causes a high intimidation rate for a short time.
}}
