|Notes=
*In order for Ou to be accessible on the last floor, all 5 [[Omen]] Boss bead key items must be possessed by the party/alliance leader who '''initiates the Omen run''' via the Earthly Concrescence in Reisenjima.
**Prior to warping to Ou's floor, you will need to kill '''all''' monsters on the circular map (Approximately 55+ mobs) before entry will be granted. The floor objective has no bearing on entry.
**Players who have a full KI bead set will receive the message "The light begins to waver" in their chat log as soon as the last monster has been defeated, and a new option at the portal will become available "Head toward Ou".
*All participants in the battle with Ou will lose their Omen Boss beads.
*Starts the fight off with an invisible HP bar.
*Casts single target Elemental Magic tier V and -ga tier IV based on the current game day.
**Enfeebling magic will be cast regardless of the day.
'''Uses the following:'''
*All standard [[Caturae]] TP moves. 
*'''95%''': Uses [[Fu]]'s '''Ebullient Nullification''' - Dispels/absorbs all buffs within 20'
*'''75%''': Uses [[Kyou]]'s '''Unfaltering Bravado''' - Conal 10,000 damage split among the targets, which cannot be mitigated by any form of DT gear.
*'''65%''': Uses '''[[Chainspell]]'''
*'''60%''': Uses [[Kei]]'s '''Dancing Fullers''' - Inflicts 2500 AoE damage (10') for each person in range, including Luopans. 
**Unaffected by [[Sentinel's Scherzo]] and all forms of [[Damage Taken]] reduction equipment or abilities.
*'''55%''': Ou levels up and its HP bar becomes visible for a brief period of time before becoming hidden again.
**Ou will also begin using higher tier magic spells. Switching from single target to higher tier AoEs.
*'''45%''': Uses [[Gin]]'s '''Zero Hour''' - AoE magic-based throat stab, hate reset, and inflicts 60 second Inhibit TP.
*'''30%''': Uses [[Kin]]'s '''Target''' - Causes Ou's eyes to light up and enables the following attack:
**'''Eleventh Dimension''' - Inflicts a 3:00 duration Terror effect on the player '''Target''' was performed on.
***Shifting hate from the player that had '''Target''' initiated on will disable this move and '''Target'''.
***Ou will have access to '''Interference''' from this point onwards.
*'''15%''': '''Gardez'''- AoE terror (20') for 3-10 seconds.
**This may be entirely resisted with sufficient magic evasion.
*'''≤10%''': '''Prophylaxis'''  - Immediately recovers its HP to 22% then will recover to 100% HP after 30 seconds has gone by.
:*This is a move unique to [[Ou]] and it must be defeated within the next 30 seconds otherwise it will fully recover all HP essentially restarting the fight from the beginning. 
::*It is possible to kill Ou before it has a chance to use this if you damage it fast enough before it may be used.
:::*All previously used abilities are once again usable by Ou if '''Prophylaxis''' is used.
}}
