*It was revealed during the 20th Vanaversary live stream that Ou's move "Prophylaxis" is a [https://knowyourmeme.com/memes/is-this-a-jojo-reference Jojo Reference]. It is a tribute to Killer Queen's ability [https://jojowiki.com/Bites_the_Dust "Bites the Dust"] (負けて死ね). In which the target is killed and a time loop back is caused back to a moment prior to the detonation.

